# training_config.js — Training Session Form Helper
# File: data/training_config.js

## PURPOSE
Manages form state when editing games within a training session. Saves/restores field values.

## DETECTION
- sessionStorage.training_config_id → config mode (editing training)
- sessionStorage.training_play_mode → play mode (just restore values)
- sessionStorage.training_config_idx → game index within training

## FIELD DEFINITION
Games define window.TRAINING_FIELDS array before this script loads:
[{ key, el (element ID), type ('check'|'select'|default=range) }, { key, get: ()=>val, set: (v)=>{} }]

## KEY FUNCTIONS
- doRestore(): Read tc_<key> from sessionStorage, apply to DOM elements
- collectSettings(): Gather current form values into { tc_<key>: value } object
- setupUI(): Config mode — insert green banner + "Save Settings" button, modify nav
- initConfig(): Setup UI + restore previous values
- initPlay(): Restore values only, no UI changes

## PERSISTENCE
Values stored as sessionStorage.tc_<field.key>
Return object: { tid, idx, settings: { tc_<key>: value } } → sessionStorage.training_config_return
